    "detailed_description": "Playing &quot;Yujian flying shooting training space&quot; will take you to experience the happiness of Yujian flying. Here, you will become a cultivator. There are many modes of flying and holding your sword!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNovice training camp, training straight-line flight, mastering basic flying skills!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFlying clearance mode, avoid obstacles in curved terrain and fly at full speed. It's time to test your flying ability!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShooting tower running mode, here you will begin to train your flying shooting ability, shooting at moving objects, which is the basis of actual combat ability!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGuard mode, use the flying shooting ability of the imperial sword you learned earlier to participate in the actual battle of defending the fairy world, release skills, and destroy incoming enemies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInfinite mode, where you will fly to evade the enemy's attack while flying to attack the enemy, infinite training, and further strengthen your actual combat ability!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt the same time, you can also buy pills to improve your accomplishments. The higher your accomplishments, the longer your flight time and the stronger your strength!",
    "about_the_game": "Playing &quot;Yujian flying shooting training space&quot; will take you to experience the happiness of Yujian flying. Here, you will become a cultivator. There are many modes of flying and holding your sword!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNovice training camp, training straight-line flight, mastering basic flying skills!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFlying clearance mode, avoid obstacles in curved terrain and fly at full speed. It's time to test your flying ability!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nShooting tower running mode, here you will begin to train your flying shooting ability, shooting at moving objects, which is the basis of actual combat ability!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGuard mode, use the flying shooting ability of the imperial sword you learned earlier to participate in the actual battle of defending the fairy world, release skills, and destroy incoming enemies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInfinite mode, where you will fly to evade the enemy's attack while flying to attack the enemy, infinite training, and further strengthen your actual combat ability!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt the same time, you can also buy pills to improve your accomplishments. The higher your accomplishments, the longer your flight time and the stronger your strength!",
    "short_description": "Individual independent games, simulation flying, shooting, breakthrough, real combat and other modes!",
